WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.130 --> 00:00:03.550
Have you ever wondered what&nbsp;
Researcher Assistant Corbette desires?

00:00:03.550 --> 00:00:08.650
Foundation Staff used SCP-978, the Desire&nbsp;
Camera, to snap a picture of Researcher&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:00:08.650 --> 00:00:13.630
Assistant Corbette while he was sitting at his&nbsp;
desk eating Corn Nuts, and this was the result:

00:00:13.630 --> 00:00:18.550
"Initially thought to be unchanged, however,&nbsp;
Research Assistant Corbette was able to inform&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:00:18.550 --> 00:00:23.170
researchers that the name plate on his&nbsp;
desk had changed from "Research Assistant&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:00:23.170 --> 00:00:29.290
Corbette" to "Researcher Corbette". Research&nbsp;
Assistant Corbette expressed extreme dismay."

00:00:29.290 --> 00:00:33.790
Though he seems to wish for a promotion,&nbsp;
he doesn't want anyone else to know that.

